</head>
<body class="brand-page council-page">
  <header>
    <a class="brand" href="/"><span>謝</span>秉舟</a>
    <nav aria-label="頁面導覽">
      <a href="#about">關於秉舟</a><a href="#experience">專業經驗</a><a href="#policy">政策主張</a><a href="#service-offices">服務處</a><a href="#volunteer-form-title">加入團隊</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="head-cta" href="/">三個網站入口　↗</a>
    <button class="menu" type="button" aria-label="開啟導覽選單" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="brand-hero">
      <div class="hero-gallery" aria-label="謝秉舟形象照">
        <figure class="hero-portrait hero-suit-slideshow" aria-label="謝秉舟深色西裝動態形象照">
          <img class="hero-suit-slide is-active" src="images/hsieh-ping-chou-suit-01.jpg" alt="謝秉舟深色西裝形象照" width="1200" height="1800" fetchpriority="high">
          <img class="hero-suit-slide" src="images/hsieh-ping-chou-suit-02.jpg" alt="謝秉舟深色西裝形象照，整理領帶" width="1200" height="1800">
          <img class="hero-suit-slide" src="images/hsieh-ping-chou-suit-03.jpg" alt="謝秉舟深色西裝正面形象照" width="1200" height="1800">
        </figure>
        <div class="hero-gallery-thumbs">
          <img src="images/hsieh-ping-chou-white-01.jpg" alt="謝秉舟白袍形象照，雙手交叉" width="1200" height="1800">
          <img src="images/hsieh-ping-chou-white-02.jpg" alt="謝秉舟白袍形象照，雙手插袋" width="1200" height="1800">
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="eyebrow">COUNCILOR · WITH THE PEOPLE</p>
      <h1>讓城市更有溫度，<br><em>讓承諾接受檢驗。</em></h1>
      <p>我是謝秉舟。從牙醫專業與社區醫療實務出發，<br>關心長照、全民健康、孩童教育與在地經濟。</p>
      <a class="button yellow" href="#about">認識謝秉舟　↓</a>
    </section>
    <section class="brand-section council-about" id="about">
      <p class="eyebrow dark">ABOUT HSIEH PING-CHOU</p>
      <h2>以專業守護健康，<br>以行動回應地方。</h2>
      <p>謝秉舟，牙醫出身，長期關注社區口腔健康與高齡照護。希望把醫療現場累積的實務經驗帶進公共服務，從市民每天真正面對的問題出發，提出誠懇、務實、可被檢驗的承諾。</p>
    </section>
    <section class="council-experience" id="experience">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">PROFESSIONAL &amp; COMMUNITY</p>
        <h2>專業，是為了<br><em>更貼近人的需要。</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="experience-groups">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>醫療專業</h3><ul><li>牙醫專業背景</li><li>全口重建與口腔重建專長</li><li>醫療管理與公共衛生經驗</li></ul></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>社區行動</h3><ul><li>投入社區健康巡迴服務</li><li>關注長期照護政策</li><li>推動校園講座與健康教育</li></ul></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="council-policy" id="policy">
      <div class="policy-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">POLICY PLATFORM</p><h2>三項政策主張</h2></div>
        <p>從健康、照護到下一代，建立能真正支持每個家庭的城市。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="policy-grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>全民健康與社區醫療</h3><p>強化社區醫療資源，推動長照與預防醫學，降低醫療負擔，並規劃行動牙醫及巡迴醫療服務。</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>長照與高齡友善城市</h3><p>完善長照服務網絡、提升居家服務品質，持續改善無障礙環境，支持長者參與社會。</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>教育與青年扶持</h3><p>擴大校園健康教育與職涯輔導，支持青年創業與就業機會，建立更完整的地方實習平台。</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="service-offices" id="service-offices" aria-labelledby="service-offices-title">
      <div class="service-offices-heading"><p class="eyebrow dark">LOCAL SERVICE OFFICES</p><h2 id="service-offices-title">謝秉舟市議員參選人<br>地方服務處</h2><p>歡迎市民就地方事務與公共議題前來交流。前往前建議先與團隊確認服務時間。</p></div>
      <div class="service-office-grid">
        <article><span>01 · WEST CENTRAL DISTRICT</span><h3>中西區服務處</h3><p>臺南市中西區<br>民生路一段167號3樓</p><strong>謝秉舟市議員參選人服務處</strong><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=臺南市中西區民生路一段167號3樓" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">開啟地圖　↗</a></article>
        <article><span>02 · SOUTH DISTRICT</span><h3>南區服務處</h3><p>臺南市南區廣州里<br>金華路二段374號</p><strong>此處同為悦舟日新牙醫診所</strong><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=臺南市南區廣州里金華路二段374號" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">開啟地圖　↗</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="volunteer-section" id="volunteer">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">VOLUNTEER WITH US</p>
        <h2>一起讓改變，<br><em>從地方發生。</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="volunteer-copy">
        <p>不論您擅長文宣社群、活動執行、行政整理或專業支援，都歡迎加入志願團隊。填寫報名表後，團隊將依服務需求與您聯絡。</p>
        <a class="button yellow volunteer-button" href="#volunteer-form-title">填寫志願者報名表　↓</a>
        <small>報名資料僅供志願服務聯繫及管理使用。</small>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="volunteer-form-section" aria-labelledby="volunteer-form-title">
      <div class="volunteer-form-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow dark">VOLUNTEER SIGN-UP</p>
        <h2 id="volunteer-form-title">志願者報名表單</h2>
        <p>填寫後，團隊會依服務需求與您聯絡。</p>
      </div>
      <form class="volunteer-mini-form" action="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeqFr5cPHDFX5E-aoZqnywSZD-OpxGo2-Jda-VTbnRG9qEjOA/formResponse" method="post" target="google-form-response" aria-describedby="volunteer-privacy">
        <input type="hidden" name="entry.791565498" value="未提供（網站報名表單）">
        <input type="hidden" name="entry.1973804031" value="未提供（網站報名表單）">
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="volunteer-name">姓名</label>
          <input id="volunteer-name" name="entry.113471279" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="您的姓名" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="volunteer-phone">手機</label>
          <input id="volunteer-phone" name="entry.595936858" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="09xx-xxx-xxx" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="volunteer-role">可協助項目</label>
          <select id="volunteer-role" name="entry.1463293993" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option>文宣與社群</option><option>活動與場務</option><option>電話聯繫</option><option>街頭宣傳</option><option>行政與資料整理</option><option>專業支援</option></select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="volunteer-time">主要可服務時段</label>
          <select id="volunteer-time" name="entry.1936268379" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option>平日白天</option><option>平日晚間</option><option>週末白天</option><option>週末晚間</option><option>時間彈性</option></select>
        </div>
        <label class="consent-field"><input type="checkbox" name="entry.2001280794" value="我已閱讀並同意上述個人資料蒐集與使用說明" required><span id="volunteer-privacy">我已閱讀並同意個人資料僅供志願服務聯繫與管理使用。</span></label>
        <button class="button yellow form-submit" type="submit">送出報名</button>
        <p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
      <iframe class="form-response-frame" name="google-form-response" title="報名表傳送結果"></iframe>
    </section>
  </main>
